### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Get Summary Statistics
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos/stats/summary

### Get Todos List (All)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos

### Get Todos List with Filters & Search
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos?search=ziptrrip&status=in_progress&priority=urgent&sortBy=dueDate&order=asc&page=1&limit=5

### Create New Todo
# @name createTodo
POST http://localhost:5000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Ziptrrip Assignment Documentation",
  "description": "Write comprehensive README.md, DOCUMENTATION.md, and API.md files.",
  "status": "pending",
  "priority": "high",
  "category": "Work",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-02T12:00:00.000Z",
  "tags": ["documentation", "ziptrrip"],
  "subtasks": [
    { "title": "Create architecture diagram", "completed": false },
    { "title": "Add API response samples", "completed": false }
  ]
}

### Get Single Todo by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos/YOUR_TODO_ID_HERE

### Update Todo
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/todos/YOUR_TODO_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Ziptrrip Assignment Documentation (In Progress)",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "priority": "urgent"
}

### Quick Status Patch
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/todos/YOUR_TODO_ID_HERE/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### Add Subtask to Todo
POST http://localhost:5000/api/todos/YOUR_TODO_ID_HERE/subtasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review final pull request",
  "completed": false
}

### Toggle/Update Subtask
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/todos/subtasks/YOUR_SUBTASK_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

### Delete Subtask
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/todos/subtasks/YOUR_SUBTASK_ID_HERE

### Delete Todo
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/todos/YOUR_TODO_ID_HERE
